    "title": "The field notebook",
    "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"content-breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> / </span><span aria-current=\"page\">The field notebook</span></nav><a class=\"detail-back\" href=\"/\">← BACK TO THE STUDIO</a>\n<div class=\"page-heading\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">THE FIELD NOTEBOOK\n</p>\n<h1>Ideas, observations,<br/><em>and working notes.</em>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"lede\">A place for the thinking behind the work. AI, software systems, deep-tech research, and the lessons learned along the way.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"blog-controls\"><label class=\"search-field\"><span>Search the notebook</span><input id=\"post-search\" placeholder=\"Search titles, topics, ideas…\" type=\"search\"/></label>\n<div class=\"filter-row\"><x-segmented id=\"post-category\" label=\"Article category\" value=\"all\"><button value=\"all\">All notes</button><button value=\"Field notes\">Field notes</button><button value=\"Security\">Security</button></x-segmented>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"result-count\" id=\"result-count\">2 notes</p>\n<div class=\"post-grid\" id=\"post-list\"><a category=\"Security\" class=\"post-card surface\" href=\"/blog/uk-php2shell-cyber-emergency/\">\n<div class=\"meta\"><span>Security</span><span>Research &amp; analysis</span></div>\n<h3>PHP2Shell: the UK’s October cyber emergency, explained</h3>\n<p>What UK alerts confirm, how early breach claims changed, and what a verified PHP recovery requires.</p>\n<div class=\"post-bottom\"><span>26 Oct 2026 · 10 min read</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n</div></a><a category=\"Field notes\" class=\"post-card surface\" href=\"/blog/a-new-home/\">\n<div class=\"meta\"><span>Field notes</span><span>Site note</span>\n</div>\n<h3>A new home for the work, and the thinking behind it\n</h3>\n<p>A portfolio rebuild that makes space for writing, while keeping the engineering work in view.\n</p>\n<div class=\"post-bottom\"><span>14 Oct 2026 · 2 min read</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n</div></a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"empty-state surface\" hidden=\"\" id=\"no-results\">No notes match this search. Try another phrase or category.\n</p>\n<aside class=\"editorial-note\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">A GROWING NOTEBOOK\n</p>\n<h2>Curiosity is the through-line.\n</h2>\n<p>Upcoming themes include interpretable industrial AI, agent-assisted development, quantum systems, and research in production. Articles prepared with AI assistance are labelled individually.\n</p>\n</aside>\n"
