    "title": "Contact",
    "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"content-breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> / </span><span aria-current=\"page\">Contact</span></nav><a class=\"detail-back\" href=\"/\">← BACK TO THE STUDIO</a>\n<div class=\"page-heading\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">START A CONVERSATION\n</p>\n<h1>An idea. A challenge.<br/><em>A good place to start.</em>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"lede\">For engineering work, research collaboration, or a conversation about turning an idea into a working system.\n</p>\n</div>\n<x-contact-form action=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfTnbNq_cn2CfGCwQTtUNxg5z5Db9USCzMUQllkSMwnDvtIzg/formResponse\" email-field=\"entry.1970826621\" message-field=\"entry.2081825816\" name-field=\"entry.145432747\" subject-field=\"entry.550228167\" subjects=\"General Inquiry|Project Proposal|Support|Feedback|Other\" submit-label=\"Send message ↗\"></x-contact-form><p class=\"form-provider\">Google Forms handles this message. Confirmation opens in a new tab. <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfTnbNq_cn2CfGCwQTtUNxg5z5Db9USCzMUQllkSMwnDvtIzg/viewform\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Open Google form directly ↗</a></p><p>Based in Dhaka, Bangladesh · UTC +06:00</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/imalimohsin/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://github.com/alimohsinofficial\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub ↗</a></div>\n"
